### 1. List wiki pages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wiki/?page=1&size=10

### 2. Create a wiki page
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wiki/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "http-test-page",
  "title": "HTTP Test Page",
  "alias": "http test,zz-http-alias",
  "content": "# HTTP Test\n\ncreated by http test",
  "tags": ["http-test", "wiki"]
}

### 3. Search the created page and remember its id
# keyword on list matches title/content/alias, not slug.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wiki/?keyword=zz-http-alias&page=1&size=10

> {%
    client.global.set("pageId", response.body.content[0].id);
%}

### 4. Get wiki page by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wiki/{{pageId}}

### 5. Update wiki page
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wiki/{{pageId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "http-test-page",
  "title": "HTTP Test Page Updated",
  "alias": "http test updated,zz-http-alias",
  "content": "# HTTP Test\n\nupdated by http test",
  "tags": ["http-test", "updated"]
}

### 6. Get the updated page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wiki/{{pageId}}

### 7. Delete wiki page
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/wiki/{{pageId}}

### 8. Verify the page is gone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wiki/1
